          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Umbral Leap"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal, teleportation)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe temagyr bends light and darkness to leap into a creature's shadow. The temagyr targets a creature that it can see who is in dim or brighter light within 120 feet. The temagyr teleports to a space adjacent to the target creature."
